            "review_title": "Review at Il Grillo",
            "review_text": "Jordi C\n82 contributions\n0\nPathethic!\nJan 2026 • Couples\nWe walked into El Grillo (Hanoi) and the restaurant was almost empty. We ordered something very simple: one pizza and one pasta. \n\nAfter 50 minutes, we still hadn’t received anything.\n\nMeanwhile, a table of four local people arrived 30 minutes after us and they had already been served starters, two pasta dishes, then a third one, and even a meat dish.\n\nWhen we asked what was going on, the staff gave us the excuse that “the dishes have to come out at the same time.”\n\nThat makes no sense: a pizza and a pasta should not take almost an hour, especially when the other table was getting dish after dish — including a seafood pasta, just like ours.\n\nAfter nearly one hour, the pizza finally arrived… but my wife’s pasta was nowhere to be seen. When we complained again, it became obvious they had either forgotten it or hadn’t even started cooking it.\n\nThe service isn’t just bad — it’s pathetic, disorganized, and a complete waste of time.\n\nAbsolutely not recommended.\nRead more\nWritten January 28, 2026",
