            "review_text": "minh Nt\nHanoi, Vietnam156 contributions\n0\ngood pasta place in town\nMar 2019 • Friends\nIl Grillo is still very good place for business, friend or family dining.\n\nit's family style, cozy environment. i like to sit on the mezzanine. u need to walk up the old wooden stairs and watchout the old, low roof bars😃\nwe ordered cold cut plate, salmon fettucine, beef ravioli and my favourite rissoto de fungi forcini. they were very good.\n\nthe shop has expressive italian and other wine list.\n\nthe shop does not have parking place so take the cab\nRead more\nWritten March 4, 2019",
