            "review_text": "Laszlo M\nBudapest, Hungary14 contributions\n0\nProbably the worst Pizza ever.\nNov 2018 • Friends\nWe order 2 pizzas on phone (salami and Prosciutto) as it was already late for Vietnam. \n\nThey arrived quite on time, no issue there. \n\nPizza themselves : oily (see pics below), tasteless, no pepper/salt and came with tomato sauce (!). \n\nCouldn’t finish, and definitely in my top 3 for the worst pizza ever. \n\n2 pizzas + 2 drinks : 20€. That’s ridiculously expensive, especially knowing that the food was terrible. \n\nCan meet expectation for people with no taste, for the others, go to other places for your own safety.\nRead more\nWritten November 8, 2018",
